---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import "../styles.css";
---

<Layout title="Bio — Jen Tyler">
  <section class="profile bio-page">
    <h1>About / Artist Statement</h1>
    <p>
      I'm Jen Tyler — a web and game maker interested in mood, narrative, and
      experimental interaction. My work explores atmosphere, uncanny moments,
      and small systems that invite play. I make browser-based games, playful
      web experiments, and interactive stories using HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and
      small engines.
    </p>

    <h2>Artist Statement</h2>
    <p>
      My practice is centered on creating compact experiences that evoke memory
      and curiosity. I favor constrained interfaces that highlight texture,
      pacing, and deliberate friction. Through games and web artifacts I aim to
      make experiences that are intimate, strange, and a little bit affectionate
      toward failure.
    </p>

    <p>
      For a quick tour of my work see the <a href="/portfolio">Portfolio</a>, or
      download my <a href="/cv">CV</a> for more details about exhibitions, education,
      and work experience.
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>
